<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Transportation Costs in China</title>
    <style>
        /* Base styles */
        :root {
            --primary: #1976d2;
            --primary-light: #e3f2fd;
            --primary-dark: #0d47a1;
            --accent: #29b6f6;
            --dark: #263238;
            --light: #f5f7fa;
            --gray: #eceff1;
            --text: #37474f;
            --text-light: #78909c;
            --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            --card-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            --radius: 10px;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--light);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        /* Main content card */
        .transport-card {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px var(--shadow);
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding: 35px;
        }

        .title {
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-weight: 700;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .title::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 0;
            width: 60px;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .text {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        /* Transportation options grid */
        .transport-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .transport-option {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, white, #f8f9fa);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px var(--card-shadow);
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }

        .transport-option:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 20px var(--card-shadow);
        }

        .transport-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
        }

        .transport-icon {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-right: 12px;
        }

        .transport-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .transport-body {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .transport-price {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .transport-price span {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .transport-desc {
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .features-list {
            list-style-type: none;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .features-list li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .features-list li:before {
            content: '•';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* City comparison section */
        .city-comparison {
            margin: 35px 0;
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .comparison-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
        }

        .cities-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .city-card {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px var(--card-shadow);
        }

        .city-img {
            height: 120px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .city-img::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 60%);
        }

        .beijing-img {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584490867455-3a8b7d391d6a?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=60');
        }

        .shanghai-img {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621778455241-db69862a1b82?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=60');
        }

        .guangzhou-img {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1630661925385-97499ce01bd0?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=60');
        }

        .xian-img {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461769770233-d4bcb84e0dce?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=60');
        }

        .city-name {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 10px;
            left: 10px;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            z-index: 1;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }

        .city-details {
            padding: 15px;
        }

        .city-transport {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .transport-type {
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .transport-cost {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        /* Tips box */
        .tips-box {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px var(--shadow);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .tips-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .tips-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .tip-item {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 25px;
        }

        .tip-item:before {
            content: '✓';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-align: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                padding: 15px;
            }
            
            .transport-card {
                padding: 25px;
            }
            
            .title {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .title {
                font-size: 1.3rem;
            }
            
            .cities-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="transport-card">
         
            
            <p class="text">China has one of the world's most extensive and efficient transportation networks. Whether you're traveling between cities or navigating urban areas, understanding transportation costs will help you budget your trip effectively. Here's a comprehensive breakdown of transportation costs across China.</p>
            
            <div class="transport-grid">
                <div class="transport-option">
                    <div class="transport-header">
                        <div class="transport-icon">🚇</div>
                        <div class="transport-name">Metro/Subway</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="transport-body">
                        <div class="transport-price">$0.30 - $1.50 <span>per trip</span></div>
                        <div class="transport-desc">China's metro systems are modern, efficient, and incredibly affordable. Fares are distance-based.</div>
                        <ul class="features-list">
                            <li>Beijing & Shanghai: $0.30-$1.50</li>
                            <li>Guangzhou & Shenzhen: $0.30-$1.20</li>
                            <li>Other cities: $0.30-$1.00</li>
                            <li>Day passes available in major cities</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="transport-option">
                    <div class="transport-header">
                        <div class="transport-icon">🚌</div>
                        <div class="transport-name">City Bus</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="transport-body">
                        <div class="transport-price">$0.15 - $0.50 <span>per trip</span></div>
                        <div class="transport-desc">Public buses are the cheapest way to get around cities but may be challenging for non-Chinese speakers.</div>
                        <ul class="features-list">
                            <li>Regular buses: $0.15-$0.30</li>
                            <li>Air-conditioned buses: $0.30-$0.50</li>
                            <li>Most routes payable with transportation cards</li>
                            <li>Some buses offer free transfers within 2 hours</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="transport-option">
                    <div class="transport-header">
                        <div class="transport-icon">🚕</div>
                        <div class="transport-name">Taxi</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="transport-body">
                        <div class="transport-price">$1.50 - $2.50 <span>base fare</span></div>
                        <div class="transport-desc">Taxis are plentiful and still relatively affordable compared to Western countries.</div>
                        <ul class="features-list">
                            <li>Base fare: $1.50-$2.50 (first 3km)</li>
                            <li>Additional km: $0.30-$0.50</li>
                            <li>Waiting fee: $2-4 per hour</li>
                            <li>Higher rates apply after 11pm (20-30% surcharge)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="transport-option">
                    <div class="transport-header">
                        <div class="transport-icon">🚄</div>
                        <div class="transport-name">High-Speed Rail</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="transport-body">
                        <div class="transport-price">$15 - $150 <span>depending on distance</span></div>
                        <div class="transport-desc">China's high-speed rail network is world-class and the best way to travel between cities.</div>
                        <ul class="features-list">
                            <li>Second class: $15-85 (most popular)</li>
                            <li>First class: $25-150</li>
                            <li>Beijing-Shanghai (1318km): $80 (5 hours)</li>
                            <li>Beijing-Xi'an (1216km): $70 (4.5 hours)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="transport-option">
                    <div class="transport-header">
                        <div class="transport-icon">✈️</div>
                        <div class="transport-name">Domestic Flights</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="transport-body">
                        <div class="transport-price">$50 - $300 <span>one-way</span></div>
                        <div class="transport-desc">For long distances or time-sensitive travel, flying may be more convenient.</div>
                        <ul class="features-list">
                            <li>Short routes (under 500km): $50-100</li>
                            <li>Medium routes (500-1000km): $80-180</li>
                            <li>Long routes (over 1000km): $150-300</li>
                            <li>Significant discounts available when booking early</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="transport-option">
                    <div class="transport-header">
                        <div class="transport-icon">📱</div>
                        <div class="transport-name">Ride-Hailing Apps</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="transport-body">
                        <div class="transport-price">$2 - $15 <span>per trip</span></div>
                        <div class="transport-desc">Didi (China's Uber equivalent) offers convenient ride services across Chinese cities.</div>
                        <ul class="features-list">
                            <li>Express: similar to regular taxis</li>
                            <li>Premium: slightly higher quality vehicles</li>
                            <li>English interface available</li>
                            <li>Payment via app (needs Chinese payment methods)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            
            
            <p class="text">For budget travelers, public transportation is incredibly economical in China. You can easily navigate major cities for less than $5 per day using metros and buses. For intercity travel, high-speed trains offer the best balance of cost, comfort, and convenience.</p>
            
            <div class="tips-box">
                <h3 class="tips-title">Money-Saving Transportation Tips</h3>
                <div class="tips-content">
                    <div class="tip-item">Purchase a transportation card in each city you visit for discounted fares (usually 5-20% off regular prices)</div>
                    <div class="tip-item">Book high-speed train tickets 7-30 days in advance for the best prices (up to 20% cheaper)</div>
                    <div class="tip-item">Consider overnight trains for long distances to save on accommodation costs</div>
                    <div class="tip-item">Use metro systems during rush hours to avoid traffic congestion when taking taxis</div>
                    <div class="tip-item">Download offline maps and translation apps to navigate public transport effectively</div>
                    <div class="tip-item">Look for city passes that combine transportation and attraction entry in tourist cities</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <p class="text">Most transportation methods in China now support digital payments through WeChat Pay or Alipay. If you plan to use these services, consider setting them up before your trip or look into transportation cards that can be purchased with cash.</p>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <p>Actual costs may vary slightly by location and season.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
